5","query":"尉遲恭","count":2,"offset":35,"excerpt":"〔篇題：卷八十九\n列傳第十四　屈突尉遲張秦唐段〕\n〔編者說明：屈突通　尉遲恭　張公謹子:大素　秦瓊　唐儉裔孫:次　次子:扶　持　持子彥謙　段志玄三世孫:文昌　文昌子:成式〕\n\n屈突通\n\n屈突通，其先蓋昌黎徒何人，後家長安。仕隋爲虎賁郎將","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:songshi-0b92ebdec33e70ed","query":"尉遲恭","count":1,"offset":6895,"excerpt":"去病、霍光，蜀昭烈帝、關羽、張飛、諸葛亮、唐房玄齡、長孫無忌、魏徵、李靖、李勣、尉遲恭、渾瑊、段秀實等，皆勳德高邁，為當時之冠；晉趙簡子，齊孟嘗君，趙趙奢，漢邴吉，唐高士廉、唐儉、岑文本、馬周為之次；南燕慕容德、唐裴寂、元稹又次之。」詔孫臏等各置","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":2,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:xintangshu-4cdd9ff519be59c5","bookId":"book:xintangshu","requestedTitle":"新唐書/卷089","title":"新唐書/卷089","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%96%B0%E5%94%90%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7089","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1757056","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%96%B0%E5%94%90%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7089?action=history","revisionId":1757056,"revisionTimestamp":"2019-12-28T17:58:25Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:53:04.167Z","sha256":"4d0eca73d1bff1b1b80ca44a9afb7ebde65c3d1439a18531bb4c56f75565aa23","textSha256":"d301f98b45c8affc867d219722d82c3cdedc05e156a1d507ab1306e48eef2b6a","expandedWikitextSha256":"4d0eca73d1bff1b1b80ca44a9afb7ebde65c3d1439a18531bb4c56f75565aa23","characters":8136,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/xintangshu.json","status":"downloaded","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-02T11:14:39.942Z","upstreamTextQuality":25,"upstreamTextQualityMeaning":"Wikisource platform quality marker; not a percentage of text transcribed","textCompleteness":"not-independently-collated","extractionNotes":["Textquality 25% 是維基文庫平台品質標記，不代表正文已轉錄比例。"],